    The robot model appears and follows
    your mouse cursor.

    

    Left-click on your grid:

    

    Places
    the robot on the selected grid cell.

    

    The robot activates and begins
    its functions.

    

    Right-click (while robot follows cursor):

    

    Cancels
    deployment. The robot disappears and the card returns to your deck.'
